left 4, right 4 per step: counts 20 and 20, wheels rolled 200 and 200 units -> straight line
left 4, right 2 per step: counts 20 and 10, wheels rolled 200 and 100 units -> curves to the right
left 2, right 4 per step: counts 10 and 20, wheels rolled 100 and 200 units -> curves to the left
left 0, right 0 per step: counts 0 and 0, wheels rolled 0 and 0 units -> stands still
